function systemView(){const entries=[row('Display & dimming','display','Adjust'),row('Bluetooth devices','devices',s.paired?'Connected':'Not connected'),row('Phone connection','phonelink','USB / wireless'),row('Clock','clock',time()),row('Steering controls','swc',s.swc.length+' assigned'),row('About this preview','about','Details'),row('Standby','power','Display off'),row('Reset interface settings','reset','Reset')];const page=s.systemPage||0;return pane('Settings',entries.slice(page*6,page*6+6).join('')+`<div class="ax-row space" style="margin-top:14px">${button('Previous','system-prev',page===0?'disabled':'')}<span class="ax-label">${page+1} / 2</span>${button('Next','system-next',page===1?'disabled':'')}</div>`);}
